{"unit_id":"yzd6552-commits__dsh-browseruse#card-zh","repo":"yzd6552-commits/dsh-browseruse","commit":"cf18e4beb7e14557e4a5f67aba4394071b9d4da9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browseruse 是一款面向 DSH 的浏览器自动化插件，通过工具接口驱动独立的 Google Chrome 实例，并把浏览器接入 DSH 会话。它提供网页打开、页面快照与截图、点击和输入、滚动、导航、标签管理、表单填写及文件下载；也能根据自然语言目标循环观察页面并调用当前模型决策，支持后台任务和定时启动。敏感操作会请求用户确认，遇到验证码可交由用户在专用窗口处理。适合需要让 DSH 代为浏览网页、操作页面或完成重复网页流程的用户。运行需要本机 Google Chrome 和 Node.js 20 以上版本，登录态保存在独立 profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:112-124","index.js:741-1136"]}
{"unit_id":"yzd6552-commits__dsh-browseruse#card-en","repo":"yzd6552-commits/dsh-browseruse","commit":"cf18e4beb7e14557e4a5f67aba4394071b9d4da9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browseruse adds browser tools to DSH sessions and drives a dedicated Chrome profile. It can open pages, inspect snapshots, click, type, fill forms, manage tabs, download files, and run model-guided or scheduled browser tasks. It requires local Chrome and Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:112-124","index.js:741-1136"]}
