{"unit_id":"yzd6552-commits__dsh-browseruse#feature-1","repo":"yzd6552-commits/dsh-browseruse","commit":"cf18e4beb7e14557e4a5f67aba4394071b9d4da9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browseruse 的功能「浏览网页与读取快照」：browser_open 打开 HTTP 或 HTTPS 页面，browser_snapshot 返回页面文本、可交互元素序号和可选截图。用户可根据快照结果继续指定点击或输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:744-810"]}
{"unit_id":"yzd6552-commits__dsh-browseruse#feature-2","repo":"yzd6552-commits/dsh-browseruse","commit":"cf18e4beb7e14557e4a5f67aba4394071b9d4da9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browseruse 的功能「自然语言自主浏览」：browser_task 接收目标和可选起始网址，循环读取页面并让当前会话模型选择动作，直到完成或达到步数上限；可通过后台任务查看进度。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:569-637","index.js:1011-1050"]}
{"unit_id":"yzd6552-commits__dsh-browseruse#feature-3","repo":"yzd6552-commits/dsh-browseruse","commit":"cf18e4beb7e14557e4a5f67aba4394071b9d4da9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browseruse 的功能「表单填写与下载」：browser_fill_form 可按字段文字或快照序号填入多个值并选择是否提交；browser_download 捕获浏览器下载并保存到用户的 Downloads 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:298-348","index.js:918-1009"]}
{"unit_id":"yzd6552-commits__dsh-browseruse#feature-4","repo":"yzd6552-commits/dsh-browseruse","commit":"cf18e4beb7e14557e4a5f67aba4394071b9d4da9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browseruse 的功能「定时启动浏览任务」：browser_schedule 接收自然语言目标和时间，可使用 ISO 时间、时分或延迟秒数；到时会启动后台 browser_task，排程仅在当前会话生命周期内有效。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:672-703","index.js:1051-1112"]}
